# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/

# This repo is a mindset plugin (docs + prompts), not a build target.
# If you keep a local experiment journal while applying the mindset, ignore it here:
JOURNAL.local.md
*.local.md

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Scratch and temporary scripts
scratch/

# Benchmark datasets are evidence, not build output: a claim in docs/ is worthless if the rows
# behind it are not in the same clone. This pattern previously ignored them while its own comment
# said they were published deliberately, so RESULTS.md shipped conclusions with no data. Commit
# the dataset that backs a published number, and inspect it for provider metadata before you do.

# The verification wrapper's scratch log. It lands in the working tree of whatever repo the loop
# runs in, and `git status` there is part of the keep-or-revert signal.
.autoevolve_last_run.log
